{'symbol': 'VIAC', 'date': '2019-11-11 22:30:00', 'title': 'CBS CORPORATION REPORTS EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019', 'text': 'CBS CORPORATION ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019. FOR THE THIRD QUARTER, THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED SALES WAS USD 3,295 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 3,263 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 501 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 690 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 319 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 488 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 0.85 COMPARED TO USD 1.3 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 0.85 COMPARED TO USD 1.29 A YEAR AGO. FOR THE NINE MONTHS, SALES WAS USD 11,271 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 10,490 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 2,424 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 2,121 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 2,342 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 1,399 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 6.26 COMPARED TO USD 3.7 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 6.23 COMPARED TO USD 3.66 A YEAR AGO.'}{'symbol': 'VIAC', 'date': '2019-11-11 11:30:00', 'title': 'VIACOM AND CBS ANNOUNCE CONTENT AND DIGITAL LEADERSHIP', 'text': "VIACOM AND CBS ANNOUNCE CONTENT AND DIGITAL LEADERSHIP.VIACOM INC - JIM GIANOPULOS WILL OVERSEE FILMED ENTERTAINMENT, CONTINUING AS CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF PARAMOUNT PICTURES.VIACOM - CHRIS MCCARTHY, PRESIDENT OF MTV, VH1, CMT AND LOGO, WILL SERVE AS PRESIDENT OF ENTERTAINMENT & YOUTH BRANDS, VIACOMCBS DOMESTIC MEDIA NETWORKS.VIACOM INC - DAVID NEVINS, CHIEF CREATIVE OFFICER, CBS, AND CHAIRMAN AND CEO, SHOWTIME NETWORKS, WILL OVERSEE CBS TELEVISION STUDIOS.VIACOM INC - CAROLYN KROLL REIDY WILL LEAD COMPANY'S PUBLISHING ASSETS.VIACOM INC - DAVID NEVINS WILL ALSO HAVE OVERSIGHT OF CBS' INTEREST IN CW, A JOINT VENTURE BETWEEN CBS AND WARNER BROS. ENTERTAINMENT.VIACOM - BRIAN ROBBINS, PRESIDENT OF NICKELODEON, WILL OVERSEE COMPANY'S KIDS AND YOUNG ADULT-FOCUSED OFFERINGS AS PRESIDENT, KIDS & FAMILY ENTERTAINMENT.VIACOM INC - VIACOMCBS WILL ALSO FORM A NEW CONTENT COUNCIL.VIACOM INC - MARC DEBEVOISE, PRESIDENT AND COO, CBS INTERACTIVE, WILL SERVE AS CHIEF DIGITAL OFFICER, VIACOMCBS.VIACOM - MARC DEBEVOISE, PRESIDENT AND COO, CBS INTERACTIVE, WILL SERVE AS CHIEF DIGITAL OFFICER, VIACOMCBS, AND PRESIDENT AND CEO, CBS INTERACTIVE.VIACOM INC - MERGER IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE BY EARLY DECEMBER.VIACOM INC - PHIL WISER, CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER, CBS, WILL SERVE AS CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER FOR COMBINED COMPANY."}